RFPlayer JAM'ALERT Community

This distribution is a derivative work based on the GCE Electronics Home Assistant RFPlayer integration:
https://github.com/gce-electronics/HA_RFPlayer

Original project code owners are retained in custom_components/rfplayer/manifest.json.
The original project is distributed under the Apache License 2.0.

Community modifications in this package:
- reliable handling of address-less JAMMING frames as JAMMING_0;
- dedicated Home Assistant entity identity for the live JAM'ALERT detector;
- tolerant OFF/ON JAMMING decoding using subType and subTypeMeaning;
- additional RFPlayer connection, raw-frame and JAMMING diagnostics;
- serial event parsing protection for malformed/unsupported RF frames;
- correction of the all_off command-state typo;
- integration version suffix 1.5.0-jamalert.2.

No private Home Assistant entity IDs, USB serial IDs, names, addresses, notification targets, tokens or local network details are included.
